> >
> > Can anyone tell me whather this would be the case or not and if so how I go
> > about changing it so that setuid scripts are possible?
> >


> 
> Did you ever get an answer to this?  We have run into a problem that I
> think may be similar.  We tried to set the setuid bit on the lprm command
> so that users may cancel printjobs of reports they may be printing (due
> to printer jams, wrong forms, etc.) that were orignially created by the
> operations dept. under a different signon. However, it does not work. DEC
> is supposedly looking into it, but I have yet to hear anything. We are
> running DU 3.2g on an Alpha 8400.
