The version of NTP that comes with 4.0a defaults to NTP Protocol Version 3,
which fixes some problems with link asymmetry.  The older version included with
DU 3.2 spoke NTP Version 2.  However, xntpd is fully backward compatible.
You need to specify (in ntp.conf) to the newer version that it should peer
using NTP Protocol Version 2.

