X-Deja-AN: 193950514
content-type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
organization: Laser-Scan Ltd.
mime-version: 1.0
newsgroups: comp.unix.osf.osf1
x-mailer: Mozilla 3.01b1Gold (X11; I; OSF1 V4.0 alpha)


In this directory, I have:

  lsla2l> ls
  RCS               cluster.c         cluster_jacket.c

On DUnix V3.2D-1, I do:

  lsla2l> echo *.{h,c} 
  cluster.c cluster_jacket.c
  lsla2l> set nonomatch
  lsla2l> echo *.{h,c} 
  cluster.c cluster_jacket.c

On DUnix V4.0A, I do:

  lsla2g> echo *.{h,c} 
  cluster.c cluster_jacket.c
  lsla2g> set nonomatch
  lsla2g> echo *.{h,c} 
  *.h cluster.c cluster_jacket.c

Spot the difference!

Bill

